note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note apps/omega-mindmesh/gate_mindmesh.om
note Wave 3 Grand Unification standalone verification gate (Linux aarch64).
note
note Pure seeded OM-2 (zero C, zero GCC, zero Python, zero Rust, zero CUDA, hw_writes=0).
note Runs end-to-end positive closed loop across Stages 1..6 + OMMM01 seal
note AND 11 fail-closed adversarial seam controls proving zero downstream execution.
note
note Compose & build:
note   cat si/directives/om2.om seed/ng/sha256.om apps/omega-mindmesh/gate_mindmesh.om | seed/out/omc > gate_mindmesh
note Usage:
note   gate_mindmesh [<omc_path>] [<repo_root>] [<scratch_dir>] [--lean <lean_path>]

